"              _/         _/       \\_         \\_           ",

"            o´        Wache---o---Wache        `o         ",

"            |                 |                 |         ",

"          _.o   _.o._       _.o._       Laden   o._       ",

"        _/    _/     \\_   _/     \\_   _/           \\_     ",

"      o<---Tor  Kneipe-`o<_ Tempel_>o´----o----Tor--->o   ",

"        `\\_                \\_ | _/                _/´     ",

"          _>o   Zelle Zelle  `o´  _Wohn--Wohn   o´        ",

"         /  |        \\_ |     | _/  |  x  |     |         ",

"     Park   o._ Zelle--`o-----o´---Wohn--Wohn _.o         ",

"      |        \\_             |             _/            ",

"     Park        `o-----o._  Post _.o-----o<_             ",

"       `\\_           _/´   \\_   _/           \\            ",

"          `Park-Park´       _>o<_             Rothe-Rothe ",

